{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.webpii","title":"WebPII: Visual PII Detection for Computer-Use Agents","desc":"Deep dive WebPII: benchmark visual PII detection untuk screenshot UI dan agent automasi berbasis komputer.","updated":1777874238048,"created":1777871776881,"tags":["notes","security","pii","cv","agent"],"custom":{},"fname":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.webpii","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"cd45538114dc258d5693f05733eec1e1","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.webpii","id":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.webpii","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.notes","alias":"notes","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.notes"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.webpii","id":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.webpii","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.security","alias":"security","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.security"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.webpii","id":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.webpii","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.pii","alias":"pii","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.pii"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.webpii","id":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.webpii","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.cv","alias":"cv","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.cv"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.webpii","id":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.webpii","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.agent","alias":"agent","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.agent"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.webpii","id":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.webpii","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":7,"offset":1040},"end":{"line":16,"column":48,"offset":1081},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture"}},{"from":{"fname":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture","id":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":60,"column":172,"offset":4924},"end":{"line":60,"column":220,"offset":4972},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture.webpii"}],"anchors":{"problem":{"type":"header","text":"Problem","value":"problem","line":16,"column":0,"depth":2},"solution":{"type":"header","text":"Solution","value":"solution","line":19,"column":0,"depth":2},"real-case-implementation":{"type":"header","text":"Real case implementation","value":"real-case-implementation","line":22,"column":0,"depth":2},"relevance":{"type":"header","text":"Relevance","value":"relevance","line":25,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"notes.security.pii-agent-architecture","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"webpii-visual-pii-detection-for-computer-use-agents\">WebPII: Visual PII Detection for Computer-Use Agents<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#webpii-visual-pii-detection-for-computer-use-agents\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"problem\">Problem<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#problem\"></a></h2>\n<p>WebPII menggarisbawahi bahwa privacy agent sering mengabaikan PII visual. Screenshot UI atau form filling dapat berisi nama, alamat, email, dan data sensitif lainnya yang tidak terlihat oleh filter teks biasa.</p>\n<h2 id=\"solution\">Solution<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#solution\"></a></h2>\n<p>Paper ini menyediakan benchmark 44.865 gambar UI e-commerce yang dilabeli PII secara visual. WebPII mendorong penggunaan OCR-aware PII detection, visual layout understanding, dan kontekstualisasi untuk mengenali data sensitif dalam screenshot.</p>\n<h2 id=\"real-case-implementation\">Real case implementation<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#real-case-implementation\"></a></h2>\n<p>Dalam implementasi nyata, agent screen-reading atau UI automation harus menambahkan lapisan sanitasi screenshot sebelum melakukan OCR atau analisis. Setelah PII terdeteksi secara visual, sistem dapat meredaksi atau memutuskan apakah screenshot boleh diproses lebih lanjut.</p>\n<h2 id=\"relevance\">Relevance<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#relevance\"></a></h2>\n<p>WebPII memperluas arsitektur PII filter ke pipeline visual. Untuk agent berbasis PC atau browser, itu berarti data layar dan form input harus dilindungi sama seriusnya dengan teks prompt.</p>\n<p>Original paper: <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.17357\">https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.17357</a></p>\n<p>Link: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.pii-agent-architecture\">Arsitektur PII filter dan security agent</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">notes (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">security (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">pii (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">cv (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">agent (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.pii-agent-architecture\">Arsitektur PII filter dan security agent</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"en